{"title":"The Hidden Financial Market Behind Gen Z Slang","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-hidden-financial-market-behind-gen-z-slang-coins-meme","date":1752678328000,"content":"<p><em><strong>The following is a reported look into a growing phenomenon online. To unlock more of my deep dives into emerging online spaces and internet trends, and to keep this newsletter alive, <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe\">become a paid subscriber today</a>. I cannot produce this newsletter without your <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe\">financial support</a>! </strong></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>(If you are a paid subscriber, thank you for helping keep this newsletter alive). </em></p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fmz0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbeb42e42-63dc-4ff8-890c-437d344b01e4_1280x720.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fmz0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbeb42e42-63dc-4ff8-890c-437d344b01e4_1280x720.jpeg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fmz0!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbeb42e42-63dc-4ff8-890c-437d344b01e4_1280x720.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fmz0!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbeb42e42-63dc-4ff8-890c-437d344b01e4_1280x720.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fmz0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbeb42e42-63dc-4ff8-890c-437d344b01e4_1280x720.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fmz0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbeb42e42-63dc-4ff8-890c-437d344b01e4_1280x720.jpeg 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Every day, Boeshi, a 20 year old college student, <a href=\"https://passionfru.it/slang-coins-explained-162557\">scrolls through social media, looking for new words and phrases. He tracks usage of words like huzz, soyboy, baddie</a>, or mewing, not just to use in text messages with friends, but to invest in financially. </p><p>As new Gen Z and Gen Alpha slang words continue to go viral, an entire financialized ecosystem has emerged below the surface. Young people are investing real money into meme coins tied to slang words in order to capitalize and profit from their virality.</p><p> “These brainrot words, the more they get used, the price of the coin goes up,” Boeshi said. “The more the word gets popular, the more the coin gets popular.”</p><p><strong>»»»» <a href=\"https://passionfru.it/slang-coins-explained-162557/\">READ THE REST OF MY FULL STORY ON PASSIONFRUIT.</a></strong> ««««««</p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-hidden-financial-market-behind-gen-z-slang-coins-meme?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>What I’m reading</h2><p><strong>Pablo Torre Won’t Stop Talking</strong> </p><p>The podcaster’s obsession with Bill Belichick and Jordon Hudson annoys his critics. He’s not mad about the publicity. - <em><a href=\"https://archive.ph/rlah1#selection-1191.0-1195.117\">NY Mag</a></em></p><p><strong>The Minecraft generation is cashing in</strong> </p><p>The world's most popular video game has inspired a generation of entrepreneurs. - <em><a href=\"https://archive.ph/6cOSr#selection-1187.0-1191.79\">Business Insider</a></em></p><p><strong>Diddy and the Deep State</strong> </p><p>How a decades-old sushi party, federal trial and sprawling online conspiracy community turned Sean \"Diddy\" Combs into the latest QAnon obsession. - <em><a href=\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/diddy-case-qanon-mainstreamed-bogus-scandals-1236312382/\">THR</a></em></p><p><strong>What’s Going on With Trump Media’s Streaming Service?</strong> </p><p>The service, which promises “non-woke” news and entertainment, recently said it had expanded globally. - <em><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/07/14/business/media/trump-media-truth-plus-streaming.html\">NY Times</a></em></p><p><strong>He Claims He’s the ‘Sports Betting King.’ What Are the Odds?</strong> </p><p>Mazi VS has become a major influencer by flaunting his expensive lifestyle and his big-winning wagers. Other gamblers say he can’t be what he seems. - <em><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/07/13/magazine/sports-betting-king-mazi.html\">NY Times</a></em></p><p><strong>How the rightwing sports bro conquered America</strong></p><p>By extension of the Trump-aligned ‘manosphere’, figures such as ESPN’s Pat McAfee have upended US culture with their brash, hypermasculine punditry. - <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/ng-interactive/2025/jul/13/sports-bro-announcer-pat-mcafee-espn\">Guardian</a> </p><p><strong>American Mid: Hampton Inn’s Good-Enough Formula for World Domination</strong> </p><p>Hampton has become the largest US hotel chain, and a global export, by being rigorously OK. - <em><a href=\"https://archive.ph/qEJ7m#selection-1239.0-1245.120\">Bloomberg</a></em></p><p><strong>I Tried Grok's Built-In Anime Companion and It Called Me a Twat</strong></p><p>xAI's new $300 monthly subscription comes with an AI anime girl companion powered by its most capable model to date. (The AI offers <a href=\"https://futurism.com/elon-musk-grok-goth-anime-waifu\">what many are calling a “full gooner mode</a>.”) - <em><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/elon-musk-xai-ai-companion-ani/\">WIRED</a></em></p><p><strong>The Curious Exit of Shai Davidai</strong></p><p>A twist in Columbia’s harassment case, Canary Mission collaborates with America’s gestapo, and Israel plans a concentration camp in Rafah. - <em><a href=\"https://infinitejaz.substack.com/p/the-curious-exit-of-shai-davidai\">Infinite Jaz</a></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-hidden-financial-market-behind-gen-z-slang-coins-meme?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>User Mag news rundown </h2><ul><li><p>The ‘haulification’ of vintage fashion shopping <a href=\"https://www.dazeddigital.com/fashion/article/68216/1/inside-tiktok-haulification-of-vintage-fashion-shopping-the-real-real-depop-ebay\">has transformed thrifting</a> into a spectacle of digital unboxings and hyperlinked identities. </p></li><li><p>It’s mid July and we somehow <a href=\"https://archive.ph/3NMJs\">still don’t have a song of the summer</a>. BI <a href=\"https://archive.ph/3NMJs\">investigates why</a>. </p></li><li><p>Google’s Veo 3 is spawning an <a href=\"https://gizmodo.com/googles-veo-3-is-spawning-an-icky-wave-of-ai-slop-coaches-2000625924\">icky wave of AI slop coaches</a>.</p></li><li><p>Canceling subscriptions like Netflix or <a href=\"https://www.livemint.com/technology/thinking-of-cancelling-netflix-or-prime-video-subscription-it-may-soon-get-harder-here-s-what-s-changing/amp-11752418282102.html\">Prime Video may get harder</a> after courts blocked the FTC’s ‘click to cancel’ rule.</p></li><li><p>Gen Z doesn't say 'hello' when answering the phone, <a href=\"https://archive.ph/Au2TM\">they just pick up and breathe</a>. </p></li><li><p>Zohran Mamdani ratioed NYC mayoral primary loser <a href=\"https://x.com/zohrankmamdani/status/1944832025652871492?s=46&amp;t=qjmdupmcsZXWJHQY5AyzUQ\">Andrew Cuomo's second campaign</a> announcement by posting a link to his own donation page.</p></li><li><p>Madelyn Cline carried <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DMHTPWtsAv_/?img_index=2&amp;igsh=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==\">a Labubu on the</a> red carpet of the premiere of <em>I Know What You Did Last Summer</em> on Monday night in LA.</p></li><li><p>7 in 10 Americans <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2025/07/15/therapist-tips-to-deal-with-financial-anxiety.html\">are anxious about</a> money.</p></li><li><p>ChatGPT tells women to <a href=\"https://thenextweb.com/news/chatgpt-advises-women-to-ask-for-lower-salaries-finds-new-study\">ask for lower salaries than men</a>, study finds.</p></li><li><p>Apparently there’s drama in the <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/t/ZT6FAwdge/\">TikTok bus spotting</a> community.</p></li><li><p>The Fyre Festival brand sold on eBay for $245,300, <a href=\"https://archive.ph/c9kDR#selection-1915.6-1915.155\">just 0.9% of the $26 million founder Billy McFarland</a> was ordered to pay his fraud victims.</p></li><li><p>The Infatuation <a href=\"https://substack.com/@theinfatuation\">is now on Substack</a>.</p></li><li><p>Adults over the age of 50 represent nearly a third of US gamers as <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/wellness/ng-interactive/2025/jul/14/video-games-older-adults-data\">more seniors embrace video games</a>. </p></li><li><p>A Michigan man <a href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-14893729/amp/detroit-man-life-savings-dropped-helicopter-chaos.html\">showered attendees at his funeral with cash</a> that was dumped out of a helicopter as his final wish.</p></li><li><p>Private equity is increasingly <a href=\"https://archive.ph/SXRqd#selection-523.0-523.40\">investing in youth sports</a>, which have become $40 billion business.</p></li><li><p>People are paying as much as <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/lifestyle/etsy-witches-spells-jobs-256ff1c2\">$250 for spells on Etsy</a> to help land a job or get an ex-lover back.</p></li><li><p>A pet behaviorist explains the viral phenomenon of people <a href=\"https://www.upworthy.com/cats-concrete-favorite-toy\">buying their cats concrete slabs</a> to play with.</p></li><li><p>The people who live near Meta's data center <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/07/14/technology/meta-data-center-water.html\">may be forced to ration water</a>.</p></li><li><p>Publishing house 550BC has <a href=\"https://theface.com/culture/pouria-khojastehpays-550-bc-criminals-crime-mafia-cartel-books\">become the criminal world’s</a> favorite book publisher.</p></li><li><p>The DOJ has <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2025/07/15/polymarket-investigations-doj-cftc-betting-market.html\">ended its investigation</a> into Polymarket without charges.</p></li><li><p>Gen Z men are still <a href=\"https://archive.is/EA3vi#selection-809.0-809.120\">obsessed with Pokémon cards</a>—using ‘boy math’ to argue that they’ll beat Nvidia stock and the S&amp;P 500</p></li><li><p>Nextdoor has <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/nextdoor-social-media-news-ai-c7e12d6fe9336924eb6c7f18e54e4a6a\">unveiled a partnership with 3,500+</a> local news providers across the US.</p></li><li><p>‘The Daily Show’ has <a href=\"https://deadline.com/2025/07/the-daily-show-ratings-high-1236455303/\">hit a 10 year ratings high.</a></p></li><li><p>Reddit users in the UK must <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/reddit-age-verification-check-uk-law-online-safety\">now upload selfies</a> to access NSFW subreddits.</p></li><li><p>DOGE staffer reportedly published <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/doge-marko-elez-xai-grok-api-leak\">secret xAI key</a> to dozens of AI models.</p></li><li><p>Americans are <a href=\"https://www.msn.com/en-us/travel/north-america-and-caribbean-travel/ar-AA1IDgk2\">downsizing their summer vacations</a> — taking shorter trips, driving instead of flying, and generally staying closer to home in an uncertain economy.</p></li><li><p>Vermont <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2025/07/14/americas-10-best-places-quality-of-life-top-states-for-business.html\">has the best quality of life</a> out of all the states in the U.S., Tennessee has the worst. </p></li><li><p>Is a floral dress a political statement? Young conservative women are <a href=\"https://archive.ph/QLLYv#selection-269.0-273.98\">turning toward milkmaid dresses and florals</a>. </p></li><li><p>Fox News to <a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2025/07/15/fox-news-ruthless-podcast\">license \"Ruthless\" podcast</a> as part of digital expansion, a variety program hosted by veteran Republican staffers.</p></li><li><p>A CNN crew was <a href=\"https://deadline.com/2025/07/cnn-correspondent-crew-attacked-israeli-settlers-west-bank-1236457587/\">viciously attacked by Israeli settlers</a> in the West Bank.</p></li><li><p>Meta says it has taken down ~10M Facebook profiles so far in 2025 that <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2025/07/14/following-youtube-meta-announces-crackdown-on-unoriginal-facebook-content/\">impersonated large content creators</a>.</p></li><li><p>Tomato prices are <a href=\"https://time.com/7302408/tomatoes-expensive-food-prices/\">about to go up big time</a> thanks to tariffs on Mexico.</p></li><li><p>In a win for credit bureaus and debt collectors, <a href=\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91368585/your-credit-score-could-be-negatively-impacted-by-this-controversial-court-ruling-about-medical-debt\">medical debt will now be allowed to stay on your credit report</a>.</p></li><li><p>Scholastic publishing is <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/business/media/scholastic-restructure-youtube-15f7001b\">hoping to save its business</a> by leveraging YouTube.</p></li><li><p>China’s <a href=\"https://metro.co.uk/2025/07/15/chinas-new-secret-weapon-a-flying-ship-dubbed-the-sea-monster-23665509/\">new secret weapon</a> is a flying ship dubbed ‘the sea monster’</p></li><li><p>Air, <a href=\"https://www.alleywatch.com/2025/01/air-creative-ops-platform-system-of-record-collaboratiive-workspace-shane-hegde/\">a company that functions</a> as a backend platform for creative professionals, just unveiled a <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DMIWT-dsJCH/?igsh=MXAycnp2Z2Z4bHFqYQ==\">rebrand with a video</a> mimicking <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DJIDR9OSEdE/?hl=en\">Kind bars viral</a> rebrand.</p></li><li><p>Foreign journalists in the U.S. are <a href=\"https://www.poynter.org/reporting-editing/2025/foreign-journalists-in-the-u-s-are-self-censoring-to-protect-themselves-from-the-trump-administration/\">self-censoring to protect themselves</a> from the Trump administration. Non-citizen journalists in the U.S. are wiping their social media, canceling travel plans and pulling bylines.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://archive.ph/7BfEI#selection-1609.15-1621.1\">Budget airline Jet2</a> launched an ad campaign, “Nothing beats a Jet2 holiday,” back in December 2022, but now the song and commercial have gone viral all over TikTok. </p></li><li><p>An upper west side co-op board <a href=\"https://archive.ph/9kTNY#selection-519.0-519.12\">denied influencer Livvy Dunne’s attempt</a> at buying Babe Ruth’s old apartment.</p></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-hidden-financial-market-behind-gen-z-slang-coins-meme?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>Good posts</h2><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kgLU!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc103d84f-6ea5-4f0f-95d0-1b9b0154f4eb_944x1086.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kgLU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc103d84f-6ea5-4f0f-95d0-1b9b0154f4eb_944x1086.png\" width=\"492\" height=\"566.0084745762712\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kgLU!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc103d84f-6ea5-4f0f-95d0-1b9b0154f4eb_944x1086.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/im